# THE MOST IMPORTANT CONCEPTS

## Things I Should Actually Understand

- I do not need to memorise every Git command.

- The most important concepts are:

    - Repository
    - Working directory
    - Staging area
    - Commit
    - Branch
    - Merge
    - Remote
    - Push
    - Pull
    - Fetch
    - Pull Request
    - Merge conflict
    - `.gitignore`
    - GitHub Issues
    - GitHub Actions
    - Code review

- If I understand these concepts properly, I can learn the more advanced commands when I need them.

